    /// (optional) REPAIRED display string — present only on the display-patch frame the dispatcher sends when a late args repair rebuilt the round display (the early announce was built from truncated/unrepaired args). The client patches the live row WITHOUT settling the round (2026-08-06 mid-arguments cut rendered "$ ?" for the whole command duration)
